# Assets Directory

This directory contains static assets for the InternMailer UI application.

## Structure

- `images/` - Image files (logos, icons, etc.)
- `css/` - Custom CSS stylesheets
- `js/` - JavaScript files (if needed)
- `fonts/` - Custom font files

## Usage

Assets in this directory can be referenced in the Streamlit application using:

```python
# For images
st.image("assets/images/logo.png")

# For custom CSS
with open("assets/css/style.css") as f:
    st.markdown(f"<style>{f.read()}</style>", unsafe_allow_html=True)
```

## Notes

- Keep file sizes optimized for web usage
- Use appropriate image formats (PNG for graphics, JPEG for photos)
- Consider using SVG for scalable icons and graphics
